:"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0131b01","n":"0131b","t":"豁然得悟如快馬見鞭影即到"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0131c01","n":"0131c","t":"障也又如黑齒梵天尚自有瞋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0132a01","n":"0132a","t":"解名之為見夫聽學人誦得名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0132b01","n":"0132b","t":"明諸見人法又二一邪人不同"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0132c01","n":"0132c","t":"不受便是附佛法邪人法也或"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0133a01","n":"0133a","t":"含文字如是四門則有十二種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0133b01","n":"0133b","t":"己義他不能壞自謂是實無生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0133c01","n":"0133c","t":"沈沒煩惱轉熾故知是有門見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0134a01","n":"0134a","t":"勝亦復自謂是無生忍如此解"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0134b01","n":"0134b","t":"化即發犢子見也或聞三藏四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0134c01","n":"0134c","t":"通別圓等四門各直發慧解各"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0135a01","n":"0135a","t":"熟難知天下好首莫測邪正今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0135b01","n":"0135b","t":"常無欲觀其妙無何等欲忽玉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0135c01","n":"0135c","t":"中論首尾以破題品破豈異體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0136a01","n":"0136a","t":"光須善汝是自行正應作惡自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0136b01","n":"0136b","t":"自執秖應生善既與見相應還"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0136c01","n":"0136c","t":"非自在我各執己是餘為妄語"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0137a01","n":"0137a","t":"途不須諍計如藥為治病不應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0137b01","n":"0137b","t":"以正相入邪令無著有著成邪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0137c01","n":"0137c","t":"修道品對寇破賊然後勳成是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0138a01","n":"0138a","t":"說上諸見無有一人併發之者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0138b01","n":"0138b","t":"理就空疑不得起若摣不破掣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0138c01","n":"0138c","t":"行計我強於色計淨強於心計"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0139a01","n":"0139a","t":"見問答殆不相應今秖此是答"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0139b01","n":"0139b","t":"見多墮網中不能自拔散心法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0139c01","n":"0139c","t":"進者雜見非精退入三途非進"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0140a01","n":"0140a","t":"見惑難除巧須方便成論云以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0140b01","n":"0140b","t":"車直至道場約此空見明諸惑"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1911_p0140c01","n":"0140c","t":"處起一切念處調伏眾生如是"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T46n1911-摩訶止觀","source":"CBETA T46n1911 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":420,"unit":"T46 頁欄"}